        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a homage to the style of mahjong games that were hugely popular in Japan during the 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Mahjong + Visual Novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the comical stories featuring charming characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting with 12 top-tier voice actors! (Voices are in Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just the story segments—matches are lively too, packed with all sorts of reactions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ What is Mahjong?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.poster.avif?t=1782433033\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.webm?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.mp4?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I've got plenty of beginner-friendly tutorials for mahjong newbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries even if it's your first time playing mahjong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters will guide you through it step by step with care!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Special Moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/605b8d7e809af1d8b3af185cbaa5c908.poster.avif?t=1782433033\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/605b8d7e809af1d8b3af185cbaa5c908.webm?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/605b8d7e809af1d8b3af185cbaa5c908.mp4?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist Kshity-Gurpa and her four companions can each unleash their own special moves (cheats).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These special moves come with flashy animation effects that feel incredibly satisfying!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Replayability Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/430de010db507d4067cdb9f7a230dcca.poster.avif?t=1782433033\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/430de010db507d4067cdb9f7a230dcca.webm?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/430de010db507d4067cdb9f7a230dcca.mp4?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you can collect dress-up outfits for the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap outfits mid-match with any clothes you've acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, clearing all four scenarios available from the start unlocks a hidden scenario!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are exclusive outfits only available in the hidden scenario, so aim for full completion!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a homage to the style of mahjong games that were hugely popular in Japan during the 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Mahjong + Visual Novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the comical stories featuring charming characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full voice acting with 12 top-tier voice actors! (Voices are in Japanese)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just the story segments—matches are lively too, packed with all sorts of reactions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ What is Mahjong?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.poster.avif?t=1782433033\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.webm?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/a1591e831897d5d534bfcc9885624ac5.mp4?t=1782433033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, I've got plenty of beginner-friendly tutorials for mahjong newbies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries even if it's your first time playing mahjong!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters will guide you through it step by step with care!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Special Moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/605b8d7e809af1d8b3af185cbaa5c908.poster.avif?t=1782433033\" width=576 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161330/extras/605b8d7e809af1d8b3af18